{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose: Convert a single spreadsheet file into any number of JSON files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features supported:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports conversion from spreadsheets in .xlsx format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversion can be performed even while the file is open in another program. Note: If you edit the spreadsheet without saving, the conversion will still be based on the previously saved (older) version of the file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can simultaneously generate multiple JSON files at specified output paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports not only regular fields but also arrays of objects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076900?t=1760652481","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076900?t=1760652481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076900/ced712dd0a24a1afa094d870838b8d69e641b2c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760652481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076900/ced712dd0a24a1afa094d870838b8d69e641b2c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760652481","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purpose: Convert a single spreadsheet file into any number of JSON files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features supported:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports conversion from spreadsheets in .xlsx format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conversion can be performed even while the file is open in another program. Note: If you edit the spreadsheet without saving, the conversion will still be based on the previously saved (older) version of the file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can simultaneously generate multiple JSON files at specified output paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports not only regular fields but also arrays of objects.</p>","de